      "lede": "完井方式决定井与储层怎样“接上”。现场的做法其实是两步：先按地质条件筛掉不能用的方案 —— 有气顶、底水、含水夹层就不能裸眼；疏松出砂严重就得筛管或砾石充填；要大规模压裂只能射孔。这一步的判据写在教材和行业规范里，是硬条件。剩下的“哪个更好”才是多目标排序要回答的，而它依赖邻井资料与投资口径，很容易在会议室里争论不出结果。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>完井设计会上，工程师先按储层类型给出两三个候选：砂岩弱胶结井通常筛管或砾石充填，低渗致密井倾向射孔加压裂，碳酸盐岩裸眼或裸眼分段。然后凭邻井产量、作业经验和预算做取舍。</p><p>这套判据本身是清楚的 —— 教材把五种方式的适用条件列成表：<b>裸眼</b>要求岩性坚硬致密、井壁稳定、无气顶底水夹层、单一厚储层；<b>射孔</b>适用于有气顶底水或含水夹层、需要分层测试与分层改造、以及要求大规模水力压裂的低渗储层；<b>割缝衬管</b>针对疏松的中粗砂粒储层；<b>砾石充填</b>针对疏松出砂严重的中细砂储层。射孔完井至今仍是国内外使用最广泛的方式。</p><p>问题出在第二步：<b>邻井不可迁移</b>、<b>多目标冲突</b>（防砂最好的方案往往产能最低、投资最高）、<b>决策依据不可追溯</b>。更隐蔽的一个坑是把“评分”当“产能” —— 打分表能排序，但产不出吨油，产量项必须另有来源。</p><figure style='margin:10px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 640 196' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='五种完井方式示意'><rect x='0' y='0' width='640' height='196' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='14' y='44' width='612' height='16' fill='#f1ede2'/><rect x='14' y='60' width='612' height='34' fill='#e8dfc9'/><rect x='14' y='94' width='612' height='88' fill='#e3d6b8'/><text x='22' y='34' font-size='10' fill='#79828a' font-family='monospace'>井口</text><text x='22' y='76' font-size='10' fill='#8a744a' font-family='monospace'>上部地层</text><text x='22' y='112' font-size='10' fill='#8a744a' font-family='monospace'>储层</text><g stroke='#8d979d' stroke-width='2' fill='none'><line x1='90' y1='26' x2='90' y2='168'/><line x1='225' y1='26' x2='225' y2='168'/><line x1='360' y1='26' x2='360' y2='168'/><line x1='495' y1='26' x2='495' y2='168'/><line x1='590' y1='26' x2='590' y2='168'/></g><g stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3' fill='none'><line x1='90' y1='62' x2='90' y2='104'/><line x1='225' y1='26' x2='225' y2='104'/><line x1='360' y1='26' x2='360' y2='104'/><line x1='495' y1='26' x2='495' y2='110'/><line x1='590' y1='26' x2='590' y2='110'/></g><g fill='#b26a39'><circle cx='225' cy='118' r='2.4'/><circle cx='225' cy='130' r='2.4'/><circle cx='225' cy='142' r='2.4'/><circle cx='225' cy='154' r='2.4'/><circle cx='495' cy='126' r='2.4'/><circle cx='495' cy='138' r='2.4'/><circle cx='495' cy='150' r='2.4'/></g><g stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='2' fill='none'><line x1='360' y1='104' x2='360' y2='166' stroke-dasharray='3 2'/><path d='M352 112 L360 104 L368 112'/><path d='M352 126 L360 118 L368 126'/><path d='M352 140 L360 132 L368 140'/></g><g fill='#a9852f'><circle cx='590' cy='118' r='2'/><circle cx='582' cy='126' r='2'/><circle cx='598' cy='126' r='2'/><circle cx='590' cy='134' r='2'/><circle cx='582' cy='142' r='2'/><circle cx='598' cy='142' r='2'/><circle cx='590' cy='150' r='2'/></g><g stroke='#5d6a63' stroke-width='2'><line x1='82' y1='112' x2='98' y2='112'/><line x1='208' y1='112' x2='242' y2='112'/><line x1='344' y1='116' x2='376' y2='116'/><line x1='478' y1='118' x2='512' y2='118'/><line x1='574' y1='118' x2='606' y2='118'/></g><g font-size='10' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif'><text x='90' y='188'>裸眼完井</text><text x='225' y='188'>射孔完井</text><text x='360' y='188'>筛管完井</text><text x='495' y='188'>砾石充填</text><text x='590' y='188'>压裂充填</text></g></svg><figcaption style='font-size:10.5px;color:#9ba3a9;margin-top:5px'>图 1 · 同一储层在五种完井方式下的井筒连通结构；颜色分别对应产能通道、防砂介质与射孔孔眼。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么：四种方法各管一段",
          "html": "<p>这个决策要用的信息散在四个地方：井史报告里的文字、相似井的完井经验、邻井的产量曲线、以及互相冲突的评价指标。所以它不是“一个模型”，而是<b>一条方法链</b> —— 读文本、找参照、定产能、排方案，每一步换一种方法。</p><table class=\"dtable\"><thead><tr><th>工序</th><th>方法</th><th>在这一步做什么</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>读井史</td><td>NLP · 信息抽取</td><td>从完井设计书、作业总结、事故报告里抽出井型、出砂、工具、措施、事故五类字段；这些内容占井史的大头，却是非结构化文本</td></tr><tr><td>找参照</td><td>KG · 知识图谱</td><td>以“井—层—完井方式—工具—效果”建图，按区块、岩性、出砂、压力检索相似井，把“邻井经验”变成可查询的候选集</td></tr><tr><td>定产能</td><td>TS · 时序分析</td><td>用邻井产量与含水时序标定采油指数随时间的衰减，而不是拿一个常数去乘</td></tr><tr><td>排方案</td><td>OPT · 多目标优化</td><td>TOPSIS 排序 + 权重扰动，给出前 2 名与排序稳定性，回答“换权重会不会翻盘”</td></tr></tbody></table><p>四种方法的分工很清楚：<b>NLP 把文字变成字段</b>，<b>KG 把字段变成候选</b>，<b>TS 把候选变成产量</b>，<b>OPT 把产量变成排序</b>。任何一环缺失，结论都站不住 —— 没有 NLP，井史进不了模型；没有 KG，候选集靠人拍；没有 TS，产能项就是凭空打分。</p><figure style='margin:12px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 640 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img'><rect x='0' y='0' width='640' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='14' y='18' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\"1.2\">TOPSIS 决策链路 · 从参数表到方案排序</text><rect x='14' y='30' width='112' height='68' rx='5' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#1e6f5c' stroke-width='1.1'/><text x='23' y='45' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".8\">01</text><text x='23' y='62' font-size='10.5' font-weight=\"500\" fill='#242b2e' font-family='sans-serif'>决策矩阵</text><text x='23' y='77' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a' font-family='sans-serif'>5 方案 × 5 指标</text><path d='M128 64 h7 m-3 -3 l3 3 l-3 3' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='139' y='30' width='112' height='68' rx='5' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#e6e0d2' stroke-width='.9'/><text x='148' y='45' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".8\">02</text><text x='148' y='62' font-size='10.5' font-weight=\"500\" fill='#242b2e' font-family='sans-serif'>归一化</text><text x='148' y='77' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a' font-family='sans-serif'>成本指标逆向</text><path d='M253 64 h7 m-3 -3 l3 3 l-3 3' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='264' y='30' width='112' height='68' rx='5' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#e6e0d2' stroke-width='.9'/><text x='273' y='45' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".8\">03</text><text x='273' y='62' font-size='10.5' font-weight=\"500\" fill='#242b2e' font-family='sans-serif'>加权求和</text><text x='273' y='77' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a' font-family='sans-serif'>权重可调</text><path d='M378 64 h7 m-3 -3 l3 3 l-3 3' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='389' y='30' width='112' height='68' rx='5' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#e6e0d2' stroke-width='.9'/><text x='398' y='45' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".8\">04</text><text x='398' y='62' font-size='10.5' font-weight=\"500\" fill='#242b2e' font-family='sans-serif'>理想解距离</text><text x='398' y='77' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a' font-family='sans-serif'>正解 / 负解</text><path d='M503 64 h7 m-3 -3 l3 3 l-3 3' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1'/><rect x='514' y='30' width='112' height='68' rx='5' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#1e6f5c' stroke-width='1.1'/><text x='523' y='45' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".8\">05</text><text x='523' y='62' font-size='10.5' font-weight=\"500\" fill='#242b2e' font-family='sans-serif'>贴近度排序</text><text x='523' y='77' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a' font-family='sans-serif'>0—1 可比较</text></svg><figcaption style='font-size:10.5px;color:#9ba3a9;margin-top:5px'>图 2 · 五项指标先压到 0—1 同一量纲，再比较每个方案与「最理想点」的距离；排序结果对权重敏感，所以最后一步必须回到人。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">立项前先对着这张清单打勾。<b>勾不满不代表不能做</b>，但每一项空缺都会在后期变成返工。清单可点击，勾选状态只在本页有效。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">储层与流体</span><span class=\"cl-s\">渗透率、地层压力、岩石强度、流体性质</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">硬筛与产能类比</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">出砂与防砂</span><span class=\"cl-s\">粒径分布 D50、出砂史、临界出砂压差</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">筛管 / 砾石充填选型</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">井身结构</span><span class=\"cl-s\">井深、井型、套管程序、固井质量</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">判断能否裸眼与分段</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">邻井生产</span><span class=\"cl-s\">采油指数、稳定日产、含水、作业反馈</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">产能项标定</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">商务约束</span><span class=\"cl-s\">预算、工期、甲方强制条款</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">经济性与硬约束</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可参考的公开资料</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><span class=\"ref\">完井方式适用条件表（《油井完井与试油》表 1-2）</span><span class=\"ref\">中国石油科普：三种重要的完井方法</span><span class=\"ref\">顺北油气田矿保方案：酸压完井占 42%</span></div><p style=\"margin-top:14px\" class=\"small muted\">口径提醒：<b>投资</b>要说明含不含压裂、含不含后期修井；<b>日产</b>要用稳定期日产而不是投产初期日产；<b>渗透率</b>统一到 10⁻³ μm²（=1 mD）。三处口径不统一，排序就没有可比性。</p><figure style='margin:12px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 640 186' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img'><rect x='0' y='0' width='640' height='186' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='14' y='18' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\"1.2\">决策表结构 · 一行一个候选方案</text><rect x='14' y='28' width='612' height='22' fill='#f1ede2' stroke='#e6e0d2'/><text x='51' y='43' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' font-family='monospace' text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\".3\">井号 / 方案</text><text x='191' y='43' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' font-family='monospace' text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\".3\">储层参数</text><text x='346' y='43' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' font-family='monospace' text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\".3\">流体参数</text><text x='442' y='43' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' font-family='monospace' text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\".3\">商务约束</text><text x='555' y='43' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b' font-family='monospace' text-anchor=\"middle\" letter-spacing=\".3\">指标得分</text><rect x='14' y='50' width='612' height='24' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><text x='51' y='66' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">A-12 裸眼</text><text x='191' y='66' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">孔隙度 18% / 渗透率 45 mD</text><text x='346' y='66' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">黏度 8 mPa·s</text><text x='442' y='66' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">预算 320 万</text><text x='555' y='66' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">0.41 / 0.55 …</text><rect x='14' y='74' width='612' height='24' fill='#fbfaf6' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><text x='51' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">A-12 射孔</text><text x='191' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='346' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='442' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='555' y='90' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">0.62 / 0.71 …</text><rect x='14' y='98' width='612' height='24' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><text x='51' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">A-12 筛管</text><text x='191' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='346' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='442' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">同上</text><text x='555' y='114' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif' text-anchor=\"middle\">0.58 / 0.83 …</text><line x1='89' y1='28' x2='89' y2='122' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><line x1='293' y1='28' x2='293' y2='122' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><line x1='400' y1='28' x2='400' y2='122' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><line x1='485' y1='28' x2='485' y2='122' stroke='#f0ece1' stroke-width='.7'/><rect x='14' y='137' width='7' height='7' rx='1.5' fill='#1e6f5c'/><text x='26' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".6\">样本量</text><text x='26' y='156' font-size='9.2' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif'>5 方案 × 5 指标 = 25 格</text><rect x='218' y='137' width='7' height='7' rx='1.5' fill='#a9852f'/><text x='230' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".6\">标注成本</text><text x='230' y='156' font-size='9.2' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif'>无需训练，只需口径确认</text><rect x='422' y='137' width='7' height='7' rx='1.5' fill='#a85249'/><text x='434' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='monospace' letter-spacing=\".6\">口径风险</text><text x='434' y='156' font-size='9.2' fill='#4d565b' font-family='sans-serif'>渗透率 / 压力必须同基准</text></svg><figcaption style='font-size:10.5px;color:#9ba3a9;margin-top:5px'>图 3 · 决策表的每一行是一个候选方案，最后一组是算出来的指标；同一口井的三行共用储层与流体参数，只差完井方式。</figcaption></figure>"
